{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"1500","name":"福至五彩","desc":"1.3小活动","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/02/76078930/ebfa25c54024e30d12bb12987428b03d_6652010779855783178.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"活动说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e活动期间，旅行者可从季同处领取道具「奇特的『留影机』」，装备后拍摄指定对象，可随机获取一张不同颜色的「相片」。集齐五种颜色的相片后，可换取「福至宝匣」，获得\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e原石、大英雄的经验、精锻用魔矿\u003c/span\u003e等奖励！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动时间〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e拍摄玩法开启时间：1.3版本更新后 ~ 2021/02/10 03:59\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e奖励兑换时间：1.3版本更新后 ~ 2021/02/13 03:59\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓参与条件〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥20级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e且完成季同的「特别留影」任务\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动说明〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(65,70,75,1)\\\"\u003e● 活动共持续10天。活动开启后的7天内，每天拥有10张底片以供拍摄，旅行者可以与好友互赠双方持有的相片。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(65,70,75,1)\\\"\u003e● 活动后3天里，\u003c/span\u003e「奇特的『留影机』」将无法再进行拍摄，旅行者将无法通过拍摄获得相片，但仍可与好友互赠已有的相片，集齐相片后依旧可以进行奖励兑换。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(65,70,75,1)\\\"\u003e● 活动结束后，\u003c/span\u003e可在季同处接取相关任务，让留影机继续发挥作用。  \u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1317","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"活动规则","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓福至五彩·活动规则〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e活动期间,可以从季同处领取道具:\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(146,84,222,1)\\\"\u003e「奇特的『留影机』」\u003c/span\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e奇特的「留影机」可以从背包中的「小道具」分类处装备。装备后,可以进行特殊的摄影…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e活动期间,每天会有不同的指定拍摄对象。拍摄这些对象时,可随机获得一张不同颜色的「相片」。每天拥有10张底片以供拍摄。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e集齐五种颜色的相片(\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(245,34,45,1)\\\"\u003e朱红\u003c/span\u003e、\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\\\"\u003e群青\u003c/span\u003e、\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(255,236,61,1)\\\"\u003e薄金\u003c/span\u003e、\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(199,124,82,1)\\\"\u003e深赭\u003c/span\u003e、\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(146,84,222,1)\\\"\u003e紫苑\u003c/span\u003e)后,能在季同处换取「福至宝匣」,得到其中的奖品。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e活动期间,至多可以换取12个福至宝匣。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓福至五彩·相片互赠〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e活动期间,可以与好友互赠双方持有的相片。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e同时最多保留50张未领取的相片。当未领取的相片超过50张时,会依照相片获得顺序,将较早获赠但尚未领取的相片销毁。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓福至五彩·活动周期〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e福至五彩拍摄活动持续7天。活动结束后，奇特的「留影机」将无法再进行拍摄。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e福至宝匣兑换持续10天。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e活动结束后,季同或许有其他的任务,能让「奇特的『留影机』」发挥作用。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1318","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"奖励说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e集齐五种颜色的相片,可以交给季同,换取「福至宝匣」,其中包含:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/03/76078930/9db8cb5448f3546241fcbba2217e8cc2_7246008346990239940.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"width:63.925px;border:none;vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e原石*60\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e除此之外,福至宝匣中还可能含有以下物品:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/03/76078930/7a5bf8318fd04718794c0f4da36074f8_4924289162941417967.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"width:63px;border:none;vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e大英雄的经验*12\\t\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/03/76078930/47bf2e81edba46f5e720c0f4c0fc1674_152687071402090531.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"width:65px;border:none;vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e精锻用魔矿*24\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/03/76078930/2d07bfdb60cb00b22a52772fcf14385c_7671348687070152552.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"width:63.4px;border:none;vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e摩拉*120000\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1319","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"特别留影","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"触发条件\",\"value\":[\"活动期间自动接取\"]},{\"key\":\"等级限制\",\"value\":[\"冒险等阶达到20级\"]},{\"key\":\"特殊限制\",\"value\":[\"无\"]}]}","style":""}],"id":"1320","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"任务概述","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"前置任务\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e无\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"起始NPC\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/02/76078930/f03cce13706c904346e351304f1c614c_1542316506877967466.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"季同\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"无\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"%E6%97%A0\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/02/76078930/f03cce13706c904346e351304f1c614c_1542316506877967466.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e季同\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e璃月港\u003c/